Let the users pick 3 numbers from 0 to 19. If the sum of those numbers is >= of 21 then that user loses, if the users and the AI pick a same number; 
-then that number is added together. The game is partially inspired by a game I played in elementary school but wasn't the same logic. This game is made for me to learn
-git and softwares using git e.g. github, codeberg, etc. Not for showcasing my Python skills.
Requirements: You will need a Python interpreter or a compiler to run this script. No hardware requirements to my knowledge (it's a simple logic game nothing fancy)
